        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1700">

                <pb facs="1386" n="1270" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 834.00/115.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-11-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 23, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Another customary revolution is on, led by Gondra and Schaerer, who, in Europe,
                    have secured two small vessels, rifles, artillery, ammunition. Jara is believed
                    to be with the Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grevstad.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
